; triu_negative_operands: j*(j-1) is a product of consecutive integers,
; so it is non-negative and even for every operand -- including negative
; ones. Truncation and flooring therefore agree, and the two VMs cannot
; part company on the division.
; i = -5, j = -2 => swap => (-2)*(-3)/2 + (-5) = 3 - 5 = -2

PUSH -5
PUSH -2
IDXTRIU
HALT
